      "  Element areas: min=0.0504, max=1.1611, total=784.53 mm² (≈ 55.7 conductors)\n",
      "  Copper elements: 1014/2040 (area: 529.1 mm²)\n",
      "  El Hajji (raw):       55946.0 W  (1014 elements)\n",
